## KB quick reference

```bash
kb handoff        # last session's state + next steps (RUN FIRST)
kb entity <slug>  # everything about an entity (notes + relations)
kb search <term>  # full-text across notes
kb prefs          # user preferences, importance-sorted
kb projects       # active projects + products
kb pending-reviews  # entities awaiting user review
kb stats          # row counts
```

Full protocol: `kb entity kb-usage`.

**Session end:** `kb write-handoff <project_slug> '<completed>' '<next_steps>' '<open_questions>' '<blockers>' ['<acceptance_criteria>']`.

