## Persistent memory curation

Two-part system: curator collects, review governs.

- **`curate-memory`** reads conversation deltas and captures what sessions miss. Daily via cron or on-demand. Writes to PERSISTENT.md + FLAGS.md + KB audit notes. **Cannot UPDATE/DELETE KB rows** — hard rule.
- **`/review-flags`** skill is the user's weekly (or on-demand) cleanup pass. Walks pending-review projects + curator flags, logs every decision.

Queues: `~/.tpmem/FLAGS.md` + `~/.tpmem/FLAGS-ARCHIVE.md`. Run log: `~/.tpmem/curator-cron.log`.

