## Fallback

If KB corrupts: `~/.tpmem/kb.db.bak` (hand-made backups) or re-run `install.sh` with an empty DB.
If PERSISTENT.md looks wrong: `~/.tpmem/persistent-backups/` keeps the last 7 curator runs.
